Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)

@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "HeadOnCollisionRisk" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :occursInScene :scene1 ;
    :hasActor :vehicle1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :night1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:vehicle1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Black vehicle approaching head-on in ego lane" .

:night1 a :NightCondition .

:risk1 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "Head-on collision risk with oncoming vehicle encroaching on ego lane" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.95"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: The oncoming vehicle is positioned directly in the center of the road, encroaching into the ego vehicle's path, creating a critical head-on collision risk.
Severity Score: 0.95